{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/321Team/fds-msa/pulls/33","id":4852244084,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUeadX88AAAABITdedA","html_url":"https://github.com/321Team/fds-msa/pull/33","diff_url":"https://github.com/321Team/fds-msa/pull/33.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/321Team/fds-msa/pull/33.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/321Team/fds-msa/issues/33","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/321Team/fds-msa/pulls/33/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/321Team/fds-msa/pulls/33/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/321Team/fds-msa/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/321Team/fds-msa/issues/33/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/321Team/fds-msa/statuses/f9f981ba8f87aa6f876f5dc6da7e2f9f774d09ba","number":33,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(loadtest): add approved 8,400-request regression profile","user":{"login":"GWONUK","id":277643063,"node_id":"U_kgDOEIx_Nw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/277643063?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GWONUK","html_url":"https://github.com/GWONUK","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GWONUK/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GWONUK/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GWONUK/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GWONUK/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GWONUK/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GWONUK/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GWONUK/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GWONUK/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GWONUK/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"APP #15의 승인된 결정안 v2 §8은 이미지 전환 뒤 20 rps 2분→50 rps 2분(8,400건) 축약 부하 회귀를 요구합니다. 증적224의 25요청 기능 회귀는 완료됐지만 이 Gate는 포함하지 않으며, 기존 gen3 CLI는 21,000건 full profile에 고정돼 있습니다.\n\n`--profile regression`으로 승인된 축약 단계를 선택하고 기존120초 무부하 관측·요청·중단 방식을 유지합니다. 기존 CLI/full profile은 그대로입니다. 새 profile은 RUN 형식·기존 결과를 확인하고 회차 파일을 배타적으로 생성해 같은 출력 경로의 재실행을 차단합니다. 다른 경로에서 같은 RUN을 사용하는 것은 DB 사전0행 조회와 별도 실행 기록으로 통제합니다.\n\n준비 카드에는 exact 앱 source/digest, Q1~Q3·합격/중단·DB 보존·회수, D-01~D-06/I01의 현재 근거 및 남은 처분을 연결했습니다. Runtime GO·새 실행창·APP/E2E 인수는 포함하지 않습니다. 새 코드의 정확 HEAD 독립 리뷰 후에만 운영 소비합니다.\n\n검증: 로컬 부하 도구9 tests PASS(6개 loopback 정상/실패 시험 + 3개 CLI/profile/중복/입력 시험), source 정적 검사·dependency locks·git diff check PASS. 실제 서버 POST·부하·파일 배치0회. source 검사는 기본 Python의 PyYAML 부재 후 기존 task dependency 경로를 연결해 통과했습니다. GitHub CI 결과는 별도로 확인합니다.\n\n근거: [승인 v2](https://github.com/321Team/fds-project-baseline/issues/15#issuecomment-5885861552) · [G3 승인](https://github.com/321Team/fds-project-baseline/issues/15#issuecomment-5886568007) · [이전 Resource 인수](https://github.com/321Team/fds-project-baseline/issues/15#issuecomment-5910524397) · [증적224](https://github.com/321Team/fds-project-evidence/pull/224).\n\nCODEX_ASSISTED. 책임 티켓: 321Team/fds-project-baseline#15, 321Team/fds-project-baseline#20. 운영 회차·시각은 리뷰 완료 후 현재 콘솔·비중첩·DB 조회 조건과 함께 확정합니다.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-14T02:49:19Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T03:20:14Z","closed_at":"2026-10-14T03:18:54Z","merged_at":"2026-10-14T03:18:54Z","merge_commit_sha":"654d7762c3e6f4cc195c4628b42d0b47c3f8e17e","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"321Team:codex/p1-short-load-regression-20261014","ref":"codex/p1-short-load-regression-20261014","repo":{"id":1374068063,"node_id":"R_kgDOUeadXw","name":"fds-msa","full_name":"321Team/fds-msa","owner":{"login":"321Team","id":315682664,"node_id":"O_kgDOEtDvaA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/315682664?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/321Team","html_url":"https://github.com/321Team","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/321Team/